SUMMARY:Myths and Minibeasts: Beetles
DESCRIPTION:Beetles are everywhere!  You may know some fun lore about ladybugs\, but did you know ancient cultures believed that beetles could do anything from making the sun rise to burning down your house?   We’ll dive into some of this folklore\, and talk about some of the common species right outside your door in this virtual program for ages 12+. \nRegister
URL:https://www.naturalsciences.org/calendar/event/myths-and-minibeasts-pollinators-2/
LOCATION:Virtual\, NC\, United States
CATEGORIES:Adults,Citizen Science,Teens,Virtual
ORGANIZER;CN="Jennifer%20Tredway":MAILTO:jennifer.tredway@naturalsciences.org
END:VEVENT
