UID:119531-1778869800-1778882400@www.naturalsciences.org
SUMMARY:Adult Nights: Social in the Shire
DESCRIPTION:Adult Nights: Social in the Shire general admission is sold out!\nDon’t miss out on the fun: There are a limited number of Member tickets still available. Members at the Curator level and above receive access to sold-out Adult Nights. See below! \nSTEP 1: BECOME A CURATOR MEMBER! \nCurator Members receive a complimentary pair of tickets to one Adult Night of your choice\, access to sold-out Adult Night events\, unlimited free admission to Special Exhibitions\, and more! \nSTEP 2: BUY MEMBER TICKETS!  \nOne Event to Rule Them All\n\nActivities\nFood & Drink\n\nGather up your Fellowship as the Museum becomes Middle Earth for a night. Lay siege to Gondor\, dance with dragons and show off your Tolkien trivia at this adults 21+ event. \nEnjoy a unique opportunity to experience the Museum at night while exploring the uncensored side of science. The event features interactive science stations\, music\, games\, local entertainment and special activities. Beer\, wine\, themed cocktails and food will be available for purchase. Costumes encouraged (but not required). \nTickets: $25; $15 Members. You must be 21 years or older to attend. A photo ID is required for entry. \n  \n\n \nCOSTUME POLICY \n\nGuests wearing masks must remove them during check-in. They can then wear them during the event.\n\n  \n\nOutfits should not contain elements that resemble or could be mistaken for a real weapon.\n\n  \n\nWe reserve the right to refuse a guest wearing a costume deemed offensive or unsafe.\n\n  \n\nAny face or body paint must not obscure an attendee’s identity.\n\n\nFootwear is required.\n\n 
URL:https://www.naturalsciences.org/calendar/event/adult-nights-social-in-the-shire-2/
LOCATION:Downtown Raleigh\, 11 West Jones Street\, Raleigh\, NC\, 27601\, United States
CATEGORIES:Adult Nights,Adults,General Events,Special Events
ORGANIZER;CN="Miranda%20Dowdy":MAILTO:miranda.dowdy@naturalsciences.org
GEO:35.7822735;-78.6395502
