SUMMARY:Learning from Lichens
DESCRIPTION:Venture into the beautiful and mysterious world of lichens! Join us for a walk through the bottomlands of Prairie Ridge as we look for lichens\, learn to identify them\, and contribute lichen observations to the global collaborative science project iNaturalist. We will learn about lichen ecology\, biology\, and how they are crucial kin. Bring water\, a notebook if you’d like\, and clothes for the weather for this program for ages 8+. \nRegistration is required to attend this program. \nRegister
URL:https://www.naturalsciences.org/calendar/event/learning-from-lichens-3/
LOCATION:Prairie Ridge\, 1671 Gold Star Drive\, Raleigh\, NC\, 27607\, United States
CATEGORIES:Children,Citizen Science,Educators,K-12 Students,Outdoor Experiences,Teens
