SUMMARY:Spring Into Nature
DESCRIPTION:Spring is an exciting time to explore nature! Ever spot a mystery plant or critter and wish you knew its name? Lace up for a nature walk through our prairies and woods in this program for ages 5+. We’ll be using iNaturalist to do some identifying along the way and submit our observations to contribute to collaborative science. \nTo get the most out of our walk\, download the free iNaturalist app and create an account before arrival. Having your login ready will allow you to instantly record and identify your discoveries in the field. \nRegister
URL:https://www.naturalsciences.org/calendar/event/spring-into-nature/
LOCATION:Prairie Ridge\, 1671 Gold Star Drive\, Raleigh\, NC\, 27607\, United States
CATEGORIES:Adults,Children,Citizen Science,K-12 Students,Outdoor Experiences,Teens
