SUMMARY:Superpowered Herps
DESCRIPTION:Did you know there are snakes that fly and lizards that walk on water?  Join ecoEXPLORE Central NC to discover the amazing world of superpowered reptiles and amphibians in this virtual program. \nThis program is for kids ages 5-13 in the ecoEXPLORE program\, but all are welcome! You will learn about ecoEXPLORE during the program. \nRegister
